* *"Given my history of retinopathy, how often should I be getting comprehensive diabetic eye exams, and do we need to adjust my current diabetes management plan to further protect my vision?"*
* *"What should my target A1C be right now, and are there any new treatments, dietary changes, or lifestyle adjustments you recommend?"*
* *"How does my hypertension affect my diabetes and retinopathy risks, and are we managing my blood pressure aggressively enough to prevent complications?"*

