*   *"I am currently taking Calcium and Vitamin D. Do I have signs of bone density loss (osteopenia/osteoporosis) that require specialized care?"*
*   *"Given my age (52) and medical history, are there specific joint, bone, or mobility risks I should be proactive about?"*
*   *"Would a referral to Northwest Orthopedics be appropriate for me at this time, or can my bone and joint health be managed here in primary care?"* *(Note: Be sure to mention to Dr. Lee if you are experiencing any specific joint pain, stiffness, or mobility issues, as this will help justify the referral).*

**Next Steps:**
