At 52, bone and joint health becomes increasingly important, especially with your current supplement routine.
* *"Given my age and the fact that I take Calcium and Vitamin D, do I have risk factors (like osteopenia or osteoporosis) that warrant a referral to Northwest Orthopedics?"*
