* **"Given my age (52) and any joint/mobility issues I've been experiencing, do you think a referral to Northwest Orthopedics is appropriate right now?"**
* **"I know long-term use of Omeprazole can sometimes impact bone density. Are my current Calcium and Vitamin D supplements enough to protect my bone health?"**
* **"Would you recommend I get a baseline bone density scan (DEXA) before seeing an orthopedist?"**

