* **Anemia:** **"Are my current supplements effectively managing my anemia, or do we need to recheck my iron, ferritin, or B12 levels?"**

### 4. General Preventative Care (Age 52)
* **"Am I up to date on age-appropriate preventative screenings, such as a colonoscopy?"**
* **"Are there any vaccines I am due for today, such as the Shingles vaccine, flu shot, or an updated COVID-19 booster?"**

