Preparing for your annual physical is a great way to stay on top of your health. Based on the information you provided, here is a structured list of questions and discussion points you can bring to your appointment with Dr. Jennifer Lee at Harbor General:

### 1. Type 2 Diabetes & Retinopathy
Since you have a history of retinopathy, which can be closely linked to blood sugar levels, this is an important area to cover:
* *"Given my history of retinopathy, how often should I be screening for Type 2 diabetes, and what are my current A1C or fasting glucose numbers?"*
* *"If I am at risk (or already managing Type 2 diabetes), what should my target numbers be?"*
* *"Do I need a referral to an ophthalmologist for an updated dilated eye exam to monitor my retinopathy?"*
* *"Are there specific dietary or lifestyle adjustments you recommend right now to manage my blood sugar and protect my vision?"*

