Since you are 52 and taking Calcium and Vitamin D, bone health is a great topic to bring up, especially in relation to your other medications:
* *"Given my age and the fact that I take Calcium and Vitamin D, do my risk factors warrant a bone density test (DEXA scan)?"*
* *"I've been taking Omeprazole 20mg daily. Since long-term use of acid reducers can sometimes impact calcium absorption and bone health, should we adjust my supplements or re-evaluate the Omeprazole?"*
* *"Based on my overall joint and bone health, do you think a referral to Northwest Orthopedics is necessary at this time?"*

