### 4. Clarifying Your Lab Results (INR)
* *"My records show my last INR was 320. Since standard INR levels usually range from 1.0 to 3.0 (or slightly higher if on blood thinners), could this be a typo for another test like Ferritin or Cholesterol, or perhaps it was meant to be 3.2? Can we review this specific lab result?"*

